        <div class="nsw-card__title">
                    <span class="nsw-material-icons nsw-position-static nsw-m-bottom-md  material-icons"
              focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">handshake</span>
                    <a href="/councils" class="nsw-display-block">For councils</a>
                </div>
          <div class="nsw-card__copy">
          <p>Helping councils deliver for their communities. Explore topics for practical tools, frameworks and advice to support effective council operations.</p>

      </div>
              <span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons"
            focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">east</span>
