    <div class="nsw-hero-banner__wrapper">
      <div class="nsw-hero-banner__content">
                              <h2>Pets</h2>
                          <p class="nsw-intro">  <p>The Office of Local Government supports councils and communities in promoting responsible pet ownership, safeguarding animal welfare, and ensuring compliance with relevant legislation. Our work helps maintain safe, healthy environments for both people and animals across New South Wales.</p>
</p>
                                                                  <div class="nsw-hero-banner__button">
                                                                                                              

<a href="/pets" class="nsw-button nsw-button--dark" >
  <span>More about pet ownership</span>
  </a>
                </div>
                                                  </div>
