        nsw-bg--white nsw-p-md nsw-box-shadow">
              <h2 class="nsw-h3">Building strong local workforces</h2>
                    <div class="description nsw-overflow-break">
            <p>The NSW Office of Local Government is helping councils across the state hire and support young people to build strong local workforces and help young people kickstart their career.</p>

        </div>
                    <div class="cta nsw-m-top-sm nsw-small
                      nsw-display-inline-flex nsw-align-items-center">
