      <div class="nsw-hero-banner__content">
                              <h2>Programs and initiatives</h2>
                          <p class="nsw-intro">  <p>The Office of Local Government delivers targeted programs and strategic initiatives that strengthen council performance, support community development, and enhance local governance across New South Wales.</p>
</p>
                                                                  <div class="nsw-hero-banner__button">
                                                                                                              

<a href="/programs-and-initiatives" class="nsw-button nsw-button--dark" >
  <span>View all programs and initiatives</span>
