  <section class="nsw-section nsw-section--half-padding">
  <div class="nsw-container">
    <div class="nsw-display-flex nsw-justify-content-between nsw-align-items-center">
      <h2>Latest news</h2>
    </div>
  <div class="nsw-grid">
          <div class="nsw-col nsw-col-md-6 nsw-col-lg-4">
                
<div
    class="nsw-card nsw-card--white nsw-card--highlight ">
          <div class="nsw-card__image hide-camera-icon ">
                        <img src="/modules/custom/dphi_components/themes/dphi_base_theme/images/fallback-image.jpg" width="400" height="252" alt="NSW Government logo" />

                  
          </div>
      <div class="nsw-card__content">
          <div class="nsw-card__date nsw-m-y-sm">
        
        08 Sep 2026
      </div>
        <div class="nsw-card__title">
                          <a href="/news/hundreds-more-apprenticeships-available-councils-under-fresh-start-program" class="nsw-display-block">Hundreds more apprenticeships available in councils under the Fresh Start Program</a>
                    

<div class="nsw-list-item__tags">
  <div class="nsw-list nsw-list--8">
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
          <div class="nsw-card__copy">
          <p>Councils across NSW can now apply for grants to employ up to 574 additional apprentices, trainees and cadets through the next round of the Minns Labor Government’s Fresh Start Program.</p>

      </div>
              <span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons"
            focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">east</span>
      </div>
  </div>
      </div>
          <div class="nsw-col nsw-col-md-6 nsw-col-lg-4">
                
<div
    class="nsw-card nsw-card--white nsw-card--highlight ">
          <div class="nsw-card__image hide-camera-icon ">
                        <img src="/modules/custom/dphi_components/themes/dphi_base_theme/images/fallback-image.jpg" width="400" height="252" alt="NSW Government logo" />

                  
          </div>
      <div class="nsw-card__content">
          <div class="nsw-card__date nsw-m-y-sm">
        
        03 Aug 2026
      </div>
        <div class="nsw-card__title">
                          <a href="/news/recognising-the-work-of-councils-during-local-government-week" class="nsw-display-block">Recognising the work of councils during Local Government Week</a>
                    

<div class="nsw-list-item__tags">
  <div class="nsw-list nsw-list--8">
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
          <div class="nsw-card__copy">
          <p>The work councils do every day to support communities across New South Wales will be recognised during Local Government Week.</p>

      </div>
              <span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons"
            focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">east</span>
      </div>
  </div>
      </div>
          <div class="nsw-col nsw-col-md-6 nsw-col-lg-4">
                
<div
    class="nsw-card nsw-card--white nsw-card--highlight ">
          <div class="nsw-card__image hide-camera-icon ">
                        <img src="/modules/custom/dphi_components/themes/dphi_base_theme/images/fallback-image.jpg" width="400" height="252" alt="NSW Government logo" />

                  
          </div>
      <div class="nsw-card__content">
          <div class="nsw-card__date nsw-m-y-sm">
        
        03 Aug 2026
      </div>
        <div class="nsw-card__title">
                          <a href="/news/nominations-open-to-recognised-outstanding-women-in-local-government" class="nsw-display-block">Nominations open to recognised outstanding women in local government</a>
                    

<div class="nsw-list-item__tags">
  <div class="nsw-list nsw-list--8">
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
          <div class="nsw-card__copy">
          <p>Nominations have opened for the 2026 Ministers’ Awards for Women in Local Government, recognising the outstanding women whose leadership, service and commitment are strengthening communities across New South Wales.</p>

      </div>
              <span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons"
            focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">east</span>
      </div>
  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

